{"sha": "db69dfc2e3e15fa1a374dd738aabd67dbfa12af299ec19af03eb222831f9827b", "body": ["\\begin{proof}", "$\\rho(g)^N = \\mathrm{id}$，其中 $N = \\abs G$（由拉格朗日定理）：$\\rho(g)$", "零化 $X^N - 1$，该多项式以单根完全分裂，故", "可对角化，其特征值为 $\\lambda_i \\in \\mu_N$。于是", "$\\chi(g^{-1}) = \\sum \\lambda_i^{-1} = \\sum\\bar\\lambda_i =", "\\overline{\\chi(g)}$，且 $\\abs{\\chi(g)} = \\abs{\\sum\\lambda_i}", "\\leq \\dim V$，三角不等式取等号当且仅当", "所有 $\\lambda_i$ 相等，即 $\\rho(g) = \\lambda\\,\\mathrm{id}$。", "直和上的可加性：分块求迹。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{lemma}\\label{lem:b3:representations:homtrace}", "设 $(V, \\rho)$、$(W, \\sigma)$ 为表示。平均", "算子定义在 $\\operatorname{Hom}(W, V)$ 上，", "\\[", "c(A) = \\frac1{\\abs G}\\sum_{g}\\rho(g)\\,A\\,\\sigma(g)^{-1},", "\\]", "是到 $\\operatorname{Hom}_G(W, V)$ 上的投影，且对", "映射 $\\Phi_g \\colon A \\mapsto \\rho(g)A\\sigma(g)^{-1}$，有", "$\\operatorname{tr}\\Phi_g =", "\\chi_\\rho(g)\\,\\overline{\\chi_\\sigma(g)}$.", "\\end{lemma}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "$c(A)$ 是等变的（如马施克定理证明中那样对求和作指标替换），且 $c$", "保持等变映射不变（每一项都等于 $A$）：$c$ 是", "以 $\\operatorname{Hom}_G(W, V)$ 为像的投影。求迹：在", "基下，$\\Phi_g(A) = BAC$，其中 $B = \\rho(g)$，$C = \\sigma(g)^{-1}$；", "在矩阵的基 $(E_{kl})$ 上，$BE_{kl}C = \\sum_{m,n}", "b_{mk}c_{ln}E_{mn}$，故 $E_{kl}$ 在", "$\\Phi_g(E_{kl})$ 中的系数为 $b_{kk}c_{ll}$：$\\operatorname{tr}\\Phi_g =", "\\sum_{k,l}b_{kk}c_{ll} = \\operatorname{tr}(B)", "\\operatorname{tr}(C) = \\chi_\\rho(g)\\chi_\\sigma(g^{-1})$，且", "$\\chi_\\sigma(g^{-1}) = \\overline{\\chi_\\sigma(g)}$.", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{theorem}[第一正交关系]", "\\label{thm:b3:representations:orthogonality}", "设 $\\rho, \\sigma$ 为\\emph{不可约}的。则\\index{特征标的", "正交性}", "\\[", "\\langle\\chi_\\sigma, \\chi_\\rho\\rangle =", "\\begin{cases}", "1 & \\text{若 } \\rho \\cong \\sigma,\\\\", "0 & \\text{否则：}", "\\end{cases}", "\\]", "不可约特征标在", "$\\mathcal{CF}(G)$ 中构成标准正交族。", "\\end{theorem}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "投影的迹等于其像的维数：", "\\[", "\\dim\\operatorname{Hom}_G(W, V) = \\operatorname{tr} c", "= \\frac1{\\abs G}\\sum_g \\operatorname{tr}\\Phi_g", "= \\frac1{\\abs G}\\sum_g \\chi_\\rho(g)\\overline{\\chi_\\sigma(g)}", "= \\langle \\chi_\\sigma, \\chi_\\rho\\rangle,", "\\]", "而舒尔引理给出左边的值为 $\\delta_{\\rho \\cong", "\\sigma}$.", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{corollary}\\label{cor:b3:representations:multiplicity}", "将 $V \\cong \\bigoplus_i V_i^{\\oplus m_i}$ 分解为互不同构的", "不可约表示（$V_i \\not\\cong V_j$）。则 $m_i = \\langle", "\\chi_{V_i}, \\chi_V\\rangle$：重数 --- 因而", "在同构意义下的表示 --- 由", "特征标唯一确定。此外 $\\langle \\chi_V, \\chi_V\\rangle = \\sum_i", "m_i^2$；特别地，$V$ 不可约当且仅当 $\\langle\\chi_V,", "\\chi_V\\rangle = 1$.", "\\end{corollary}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "$\\chi_V = \\sum m_i\\chi_{V_i}$", "（由\\cref{prop:b3:representations:charbasics}）；分别与", "每个 $\\chi_{V_i}$ 作内积，并利用正交性。两个", "特征标相等的表示有相同的重数，", "从而同构。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{theorem}[正则表示]", "\\label{thm:b3:representations:regular}", "设 $\\chi_1, \\dots, \\chi_r$ 为互不相同的不可约", "特征标，次数为 $n_i = \\chi_i(e)$。正则", "表示分解时重数为 $m_i = n_i$；", "因此", "\\[", "\\sum_{i=1}^{r} n_i^2 = \\abs G,", "\\qquad", "\\sum_i n_i\\chi_i(g) = 0 \\quad (g \\neq e).", "\\]", "\\end{theorem}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "正则特征标：$\\chi_{\\mathrm{reg}}(g) =", "\\#\\{h : gh = h\\}$，其值为 $\\abs G$（$g = e$ 时），否则为 $0$。", "故 $m_i = \\langle \\chi_i,\\chi_{\\mathrm{reg}}\\rangle =", "\\frac1{\\abs G}\\overline{\\chi_i(e)}\\,\\abs G = n_i$。将", "$\\chi_{\\mathrm{reg}} = \\sum n_i\\chi_i$ 在 $e$ 与 $g \\neq e$ 处求值，", "即得上面所示的两个等式。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{theorem}\\label{thm:b3:representations:numberirr}", "不可约特征标在", "$\\mathcal{CF}(G)$ 中构成标准正交\\emph{基}：不可约表示的个数", "等于 $G$ 的共轭类个数。", "\\end{theorem}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "只需证明完备性：设 $f \\in \\mathcal{CF}(G)$", "与每个 $\\chi_i$ 正交，证明 $f = 0$。对一个", "表示 $(V,\\rho)$，令 $T_{f,\\rho} = \\frac{1}{\\abs G}", "\\sum_g \\overline{f(g)}\\,\\rho(g)$。它是等变的：对 $h \\in", "G$,", "\\[", "\\rho(h)T_{f,\\rho}\\rho(h)^{-1} = \\frac1{\\abs G}\\sum_g", "\\overline{f(g)}\\rho(hgh^{-1})", "= \\frac1{\\abs G}\\sum_{g'}\\overline{f(h^{-1}g'h)}\\rho(g') =", "T_{f,\\rho}", "\\]", "（$f$ 为类函数）。若 $\\rho$ 为不可约表示，次数为", "$n$，由舒尔引理得 $T_{f,\\rho} = \\lambda\\,\\mathrm{id}$，其中", "\\[", "\\lambda = \\frac{\\operatorname{tr}T_{f,\\rho}}{n}", "= \\frac{1}{n\\abs G}\\sum_g \\overline{f(g)}\\,\\chi_\\rho(g)", "= \\frac1n\\,\\langle f, \\chi_\\rho\\rangle = 0 .", "\\]", "于是 $T_{f,\\rho} = 0$ 在每个不可约表示上成立，从而（由直和）在", "\\emph{任一}表示 --- 特别地，在正则表示上亦成立。", "将其作用于基向量 $e_e$：$0 = T_{f,\\mathrm{reg}}e_e =", "\\frac1{\\abs G}\\sum_g\\overline{f(g)}e_g$，从而迫使每个", "$\\overline{f(g)} = 0$。因此标准正交族", "$(\\chi_i)$ 张成 $\\mathcal{CF}(G)$，其维数即为", "共轭类的个数。", "\\end{proof}", ""]}